    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_09",
      "hash64": "A0255B35E046C95D",
      "text": "A-Am besten liest du erst mal, was dadrauf\\nsteht...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "3631694BB7E1ED0A",
      "text": "Der Oni besaß vier sonderbare Masken,\\ndie herrlich funkelten.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_system_02",
      "hash64": "3631684BB7E1EB57",
      "text": "Je nachdem, welche Maske er trug, ergriff eine\\nandere Kraft Besitz von der Keule, die der Oni\\r\\nschwang.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_system_03",
      "hash64": "3631674BB7E1E9A4",
      "text": "Setzte er die grüne Maske auf, hauchte er\\nwelken Pflanzen neues Leben ein.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_system_04",
      "hash64": "3631664BB7E1E7F1",
      "text": "Trug er die rote Maske, verwandelte er das\\nFlämmchen einer Kerze in loderndes Feuer.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_system_05",
      "hash64": "3631654BB7E1E63E",
      "text": "Fiel seine Wahl auf die blaue Maske, konnte er\\ndem Lauf eines Flusses Einhalt gebieten.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_system_06",
      "hash64": "3631644BB7E1E48B",
      "text": "Die graue Maske gestattete es ihm derweil,\\nharte Felsen mühelos zu zermahlen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_system_07",
      "hash64": "3631634BB7E1E2D8",
      "text": "Ehe die drei Gefährten fielen, gelang es ihnen,\\nsich dreier Masken zu bemächtigen und den Oni\\r\\nso nahezu seiner ganzen Kraft zu berauben.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_10",
      "hash64": "A028D835E049D39B",
      "text": "Na, alles gelesen...?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
