    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_32",
      "hash64": "A021CA35E0439D23",
      "text": "Die von den drei Gefährten geklauten Masken\\nwerden übrigens im Kulturzentrum aufbewahrt.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_14",
      "hash64": "A028DC35E049DA67",
      "text": "Die Leute aus dem Dorf fürchten sich alle vor\\ndem Oni, aber ich... find ihn toll.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_15",
      "hash64": "A028DB35E049D8B4",
      "text": "Er ist stark und cool... Außerdem juckt’s\\nihn nicht, dass die Menschen ihn meiden...\\c\\nIch bewundere ihn schon, seit ich klein bin.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_33",
      "hash64": "A021C935E0439B70",
      "text": "Ich wär auch gern so cool wie der Oni...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_34",
      "hash64": "A021D035E043A755",
      "text": "Aber selbst an der Akademie regelt irgendwie\\nimmer Hana alles für mich...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_35",
      "hash64": "A021CF35E043A5A2",
      "text": "Ich will stärker werden... für mich. Damit ich mich\\nselbst um meinen Kram kümmern kann.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_36",
      "hash64": "A021CE35E043A3EF",
      "text": "Nicht immer von anderen abhängig sein,\\nweißt du...\\c\\nUnd vielleicht kann ich mich dann sogar mit dem\\nOni anfreunden.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_16",
      "hash64": "A028DE35E049DDCD",
      "text": "Oh, äh, fast vergessen... Wir müssen ja noch\\nein Foto machen.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_17",
      "hash64": "A028DD35E049DC1A",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Mach du das bitte wieder,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
