      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_select_07",
      "hash64": "F3A40110EE588DFB",
      "text": "Ja, unbedingt!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_select_08",
      "hash64": "F3A3FE10EE5888E2",
      "text": "Hm, ich weiß nicht so recht...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_40",
      "hash64": "A032CA35E0521056",
      "text": "Ooh, das freut mich! Ich find’s mega, dass du\\ndich auch so für den Oni interessierst.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_41",
      "hash64": "A032CB35E0521209",
      "text": "Ich will dich auch zu nichts zwingen, echt nicht!\\nIch würd dir nur gern zeigen, wo er leben soll...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_42",
      "hash64": "A032C835E0520CF0",
      "text": "Wenn du dem Weg da folgst, kommst du zum\\nInfernopass. Kurz davor stehen Schilder, die dir\\r\\nden Weg zur Schreckenshöhle weisen.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_43",
      "hash64": "A032C935E0520EA3",
      "text": "D-Diesmal geh ich aber vor. Ich treff dich dann\\noben, okay? Sei vorsichtig![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
